@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+## Context
+
+`src/patch.ts` already has helpers for own-property-safe member setting and cloning.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Implement the RFC pseudocode recursively in `src/merge-patch.ts`, building new objects (no input mutation), setting members via `Object.defineProperty` to be safe with `__proto__`.
+- Results never share structure with the patch.
+- No error type: every JSON value is a valid input.
