@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386), which is simpler than JSON Patch. The library should apply them.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` exported from `src/index.ts`, following RFC 7386.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 merge patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New module `src/merge-patch.ts`, new export in `src/index.ts`. No dependencies.
